# Language

- All **user-facing product copy** (UI labels, buttons, empty states, emails, errors shown to users, OpenAPI summaries meant for operators) must be **English**.
- Do not introduce Polish (or other) strings into `apps/web` or operator-facing API messages.
- Code comments and internal docs may use English only as well for consistency.
- If the user writes in another language, reply in their language when conversing, but **ship product strings in English**.
